Comment:
 uictl's architecture was informed by studying ydotool
 (https://github.com/ReimuNotMoe/ydotool, AGPL-3.0) as prior art. No
 code was copied: this is a cleanroom implementation with a different
 wire protocol, a policy and audit layer ydotool does not have, and a
 permissive licence chosen so that dependent projects are not
 contaminated. See ydotool-analysis.md in the source tree.
